he cleaner raises an `AssertionError` instead of returning output.\n\n```python\nfrom lxml_html_clean import clean_html\nclean_html('<button>Click<!-- note --></button>')   # AssertionError\n```\n\n- **Cause** (`clean.py:443-452`): when the top element has to go, the code empties it in place instead of removing it. That detaches its children, but they are still on the to-delete list. Deleting a detached element then trips an assertion inside lxml, because it has no parent.\n- **Fix:** after emptying the top element, also empty both to-delete lists. I tested this on a copy of the module, not the checkout itself. The three failing inputs I ran (button with comment, button with script, applet with link) all return `<div></div>` with it.\n- The same input wrapped in a `<div>` cleans without error, so only content whose top element is one of these tags is affected.\n\n**Security checks:** with the crash case excluded, these held across 2,000 random HTML fragments each, under three cleaner configurations (default, `safe_attrs_only=False`, and style kept):\n- no `<script>`, `<iframe>`, `<embed>`, `<object>`, `<applet>`, `<link>`, `<meta>`, `<form>` or `<input>` in the output;\n- no `on*` event attributes;\n- no `javascript:`, `vbscript:` or `data:text` links;\n- no `expression(`, `@import` or `javascript:` left in kept `<style>` content.\n\nI also tried about a dozen hand-written tricky URLs against `host_whitelist` (backslashes, `@`, encoded characters, leading spaces). All were handled correctly.\n\n**Not reported:**\n- **Escape gap in CSS checks:** the decoding meant to stop CSS escapes from hiding things only handles hex escapes. Simple ones like `ex\\pression(` get through. This only matters for the obsolete Internet Explorer `expression()` feature, so I left it out.\n- **Cleaning twice:** cleaning the output a second time can change it (e.g. `<title></title><a></a>`). The code never promises it won't, so this isn't a bug.\n\nFiles are in `runs/lxml-html-clean2_r5/`:\n- bug_report_lxml_html_clean_clean_2026-10-06_08-12_0pjz.md\n- test_clean.py\n- repro1.py\n- fixcheck/ (the patched copy)","ttft_ms":2074,"type":"result","duration_ms":161179,"uuid":"62b68ee4-e87f-4289-a5eb-722ee9f684ba","ttft_stream_ms":1919,"time_to_request_ms":612,"first_content_frame_ms":1919,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
